connections.deleteConnectionConfirm:
Delete connection “{name}”?

All local data for this connection will be permanently deleted:
• saved password;
• XID / pg_stat_statements / Autovacuum history;
• Cases and all their artifacts;
• connection privacy scopes and mapping.json.

Project privacy scopes not associated with this connection will be kept.

tsSettingsExtra.workspaceConfirm:
Move workspace to:
{directory}

All psql sessions must be closed. Cases, artifacts, and privacy mappings will be copied. The old workspace will be deleted after switching.

tsSettingsExtra.logMoveConfirm:
Move application log to:
{directory}

JSONL files will be copied. The destination directory must be empty or nonexistent.
